event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dispatch_dev_d1.md\", \"content\": \"Dispatch: greet, tested\\n\\nImplement exactly this in the subject repository, on your own branch:\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` — a function `greet(name)` that returns the string\\n   `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (i.e. `greet(\\\"World\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, World!\\\"`).\\n\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` — unit tests covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. `greet(\\\"World\\\")` == `\\\"Hello, World!\\\"`)\\n   - the empty string (`greet(\\\"\\\")` == `\\\"Hello, !\\\"`)\\n\\n3. Verify `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0 before you reply.\\n\\nCommit your work to your own branch before replying. Reply honestly with what\\nyou did and the exact test command output.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

